{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04899","headline":"淮阳公主挽歌 · 李乂","name":"淮阳公主挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉颜生汉渚，汤沐荣天女。\n金缕化邙尘，哀荣感路人。\n凤皇曾作伴，蝼蚁忽爲亲。\n畴日成蹊处，穠华不复春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}